# Graphify Codex hooks stay machine-local: they carry an absolute path.
.codex/hooks.json

# Agent plugin sources live once, under .djts/: skills, agent definitions,
# manifests, and the scripts that project agents to Codex. .workspace/ holds
# local working notes and Firecrawl output.
#
# .claude/ and .codex/ keep only what a harness hardcodes: config that names
# absolute paths to locally installed binaries, plus the links and the generated
# projection that let each one reach .djts/. None of that is shareable.
# .agents/ is not ours either: it is the path Codex scans, and it holds one link.
.claude/*
/.agents/
.workspace/audits/
.workspace/handoffs/
.workspace/ideas/
.workspace/reports/
.workspace/specs/
.workspace/tools/

# img/ ships only what README renders: the two hero boards and the numbered
# concept boards. The .html sources that render them stay local, together with
# the Rhythm Lab workspace captures the hero is composed from.
img/*
!img/dj-track-similarity-hero.png
!img/rhythm-lab-hero.png
!img/[0-9][0-9]-*.png
